{"id":"n15246-1-7","stage":4,"title":"라켓 · 球拍","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15246-1-7-1","ko":"라켓을 바르게 잡는 법 좀 알려 줘.","zh":"能教我怎么正确握拍吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"라켓을","meaning":"球拍","explanation":"라켓：球拍；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"라켓","audio":"/audio/703669c30ac524471a71.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15246","senseId":"1","lemma":"라켓","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바르게","meaning":"正，直","explanation":"바르다：正，直；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"바르다","audio":"/audio/3b42ecf8717cc7fd3927.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56537","senseId":"1","lemma":"바르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잡는","meaning":"抓，揪","explanation":"잡다：抓，揪；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"잡다","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70378","senseId":"1","lemma":"잡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"법","meaning":"做某事的方法或方式。","explanation":"법：做某事的方法或方式。","readings":[{"term":"법","audio":"/audio/bc47fef03a447a939586.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62407","senseId":"1","lemma":"법","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알려","meaning":"告知","explanation":"알리다：告知；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"알리다","audio":"/audio/c8eae4fd8a7a21d57d22.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29770","senseId":"1","lemma":"알리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줘.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"703669c30ac52447","term":"라켓","zh":"球拍","audio":"/audio/703669c30ac524471a71.mp3","entryId":"15246","definition":"打羽毛球、乒乓球、网球等的器材。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"3b42ecf8717cc7fd","term":"바르다","zh":"正，直","audio":"/audio/3b42ecf8717cc7fd3927.mp3","entryId":"56537","definition":"不倾斜、不歪斜、不弯曲，笔直而端正。","pronunciation":["바르다"]},{"id":"b8cc8df3de72c173","term":"잡다","zh":"抓，揪","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3","entryId":"70378","definition":"用手握住不放。","pronunciation":["잡따"]},{"id":"bc47fef03a447a93","term":"법","zh":"做某事的方法或方式。","audio":"/audio/bc47fef03a447a939586.mp3","entryId":"62407","definition":"做某事的方法或方式。","pronunciation":["법"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"c8eae4fd8a7a21d5","term":"알리다","zh":"告知","audio":"/audio/c8eae4fd8a7a21d57d22.mp3","entryId":"29770","definition":"使醒悟或得知原本不知道或忘记的事情。","pronunciation":["알리다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/41989e3117eedb09a61e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15246-1-7-2","ko":"좋아. 먼저 오른손을 펴 봐.","zh":"好的。先伸开右手看看。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좋아.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먼저","meaning":"先","explanation":"먼저：先","readings":[{"term":"먼저","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54840","senseId":"1","lemma":"먼저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오른손을","meaning":"右手","explanation":"오른손：右手；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"오른손","audio":"/audio/3e8c5f7fa68d11c1a56c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68100","senseId":"1","lemma":"오른손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"펴","